process as the most recent Alpha AXP chips.

Users can obtain superior performance with either VAX or Alpha AXP systems,
and the new VAX systems have more to offer than most of the competing
systems from HP, IBM, and Sun. For example, the new VAX 4000 Model 705A
offers 280 TPS -- comparable to the HP 9000 H50 -- at lower prices.

