Designed with a 137 MHz NVAX chip and more than 50 VUPs per CPU, these new
industry leading enterprise systems can be expanded with up to six CPUs.
Their price/performance is impressive: for example, the VAX 7000 Model 710
delivers up to 50 percent more performance than the Model 610 -- and with no
price increase. Users can run their new, business-wide applications on these
systems or cluster them into their existing environment. What's more, with
the VAX 7000 Model 700 family, the path to the Alpha AXP platform is a smooth
