New Payment Method for Per Event Services Offers Fast Response

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Pay for services with VISA or Mastercard

o  Fast, easy method to secure remote services

SERVICE DESCRIPTION

Digital's U.S. Customer Support Center now accepts VISA and Mastercard as
payment methods for remote Per Event Services. This enables users to secure
services quickly and easily with a valid card number and authorization. This
is a useful service for users whose service requests are beyond their
current contract level, or for products that are not currently under a
service contract.

BENEFITS

The key benefit -- users can obtain service for a product when the timing is
critical. Without this method in place, the user is required to provide
secured funds (i.e., purchase order) prior to service implementation -- a
nearly impossible task in time critical cases.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

Per Event Services are available now through Digital's U.S. Customer Support
Center. To take advantage of this offer, users should call the Customer
Support Center at 1-800-354-9000 (U.S. only).


