   OpenVMS AXP systems

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The DNSES EISA synchronous communications controller is a high speed option
for Digital's EISA based DEC OSF/1 and OpenVMS AXP systems. It enables users
to implement wide area communications in DECnet/OSI, X.25, TCP/IP, and IBM
