 STAFFORDSHIRE UNIVERSITY MOVES ORACLE DEVELOPERS FROM VAX TO ALPHA
 AXP.....Wanting to maintain an adequate response time for their student
 population of Oracle developers, Staffordshire University recently
 moved their VAX/VMS system to Alpha AXP running OpenVMS technology. The
 University continued to use it's old VAX/VMS system running Oracle 7
 until the Alpha AXP system was installed and went live. Tests were done
